{"4408710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Traffic Stop Anomaly", "steam_appid": 4408710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're a traffic cop on nightshift patrol along a deserted  foggy road.<br>Another vehicle is spotted.  <br>Your task is clear:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initiate sirens and pull over the vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach  with caution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the window to roll down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/0228a396dd225f75d071dcf5da0c7a82.poster.avif?t=1787206849\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/0228a396dd225f75d071dcf5da0c7a82.webm?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/0228a396dd225f75d071dcf5da0c7a82.mp4?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't overlook any anomalies.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If everything appears normal, allow the driver to leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/147b69c0b870450f0f8298855ab08712.poster.avif?t=1787206849\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/147b69c0b870450f0f8298855ab08712.webm?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/147b69c0b870450f0f8298855ab08712.mp4?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If an anomaly is spotted, turn back and drive away immediately.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> One mistake, and the loop resets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/0180b1e26f3ad58ae29b0a36e2908252.avif?t=1787206849\" width=1548 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get 8 correct decisions in a row to reach the end of your shift: 6:00 AM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest closes in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vehicles are never quite the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is always watching.<br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror in the anomaly-spotting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie rural highway setting with an oppressive, evolving forest backdrop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of subtle and disturbing anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow, tense loops with addictive &quot;one more try&quot; gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset-on-error progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter eggs and secret codes accessible with the squad car laptop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on performance</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're a traffic cop on nightshift patrol along a deserted  foggy road.<br>Another vehicle is spotted.  <br>Your task is clear:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initiate sirens and pull over the vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach  with caution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the window to roll down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/0228a396dd225f75d071dcf5da0c7a82.poster.avif?t=1787206849\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/0228a396dd225f75d071dcf5da0c7a82.webm?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/0228a396dd225f75d071dcf5da0c7a82.mp4?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't overlook any anomalies.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If everything appears normal, allow the driver to leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/147b69c0b870450f0f8298855ab08712.poster.avif?t=1787206849\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/147b69c0b870450f0f8298855ab08712.webm?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408710/extras/147b69c0b870450f0f8298855ab08712.mp4?t=1787206849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If an anomaly is spotted, turn back and drive away immediately.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> One mistake, and the loop resets.</strong></p>